17. First implementation milestone
Build a production-quality "Visit Saturn" vertical slice, not a giant catalog. It should combine a textured 3D Saturn, rings, 360° orbit camera, zoom, lighting, source provenance, 5 factual callouts, a 30-second optional narrated/captioned journey, lower-end mobile fallback and basic tests. This proves the core technical and learning experience before scale-up.
